+
+Concurrency characterization uses real child processes and explicit barriers:
+pause after manager exit before the after-image read, or after the ownership
+hash check before project publication; let a second process write both known
+human markers, acknowledge the write, then release the paused operation.
+Never use timing sleeps as the only ordering proof. Kill the real resolver at
+the journal/act/result/publication boundaries and inspect durable state on
+resume. A direct SETTLE unit test is useful but cannot qualify process races.
+Windows mutation admission stays intact; run pipeline/process controls on
+supported POSIX. Tests and observations not actually executed remain pending.
